(5493219, 792076, 72103, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous photo.......Grunge?  I''m not sure, but gorgeous photo - 7</td>', 'Gorgeous photo.......Grunge?  I''m not sure, but gorgeous photo - 7', '2009-05-20 01:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
