(5500609, 792357, 77192, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t call the White Stripes grunge, but hey.<br/> <br/>It''s a great shot and I like the double meaning you''ve got - the song title as well as the muddy elephant itself. I''d be inclined to crop the space on the left and, if I''m honest, I''d like to see both eyes more clearly (perhaps move round to your left a bit) but you''ve handled the details on the shot very well and I like this a lot.</td>', 'I wouldn''t call the White Stripes grunge, but hey. It''s a great shot and I like the double meaning you''ve got - the song title as well as the muddy elephant itself. I''d be inclined to crop the space on the left and, if I''m honest, I''d like to see both eyes more clearly (perhaps move round to your left a bit) but you''ve handled the details on the shot very well and I like this a lot.', '2009-05-26 15:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
