(5501275, 792331, 102925, '<td valign="top">Not contrived at all. It''s nice to see photos with thinking behind them.<br/>It''s certainly an interesting effect. Maybe if you added a bit of noise in the sky you could have eliminated that distracting banding. Also the model''s hair looks really stark against the sky, making it look a little cut out.<br/>But don''t get me wrong, I think it''s an awesome composition and I gave you points for the concept. Nice one.</td>', 'Not contrived at all. It''s nice to see photos with thinking behind them.It''s certainly an interesting effect. Maybe if you added a bit of noise in the sky you could have eliminated that distracting banding. Also the model''s hair looks really stark against the sky, making it look a little cut out.But don''t get me wrong, I think it''s an awesome composition and I gave you points for the concept. Nice one.', '2009-05-27 02:08:44.000000', NULL, 0),
