(5521762, 792363, 75034, '<td valign="top">C, I''m shocked to see that the good people of DPC were unable to pull themselves along the definition of grunge a little further and if they had they would have found that this image is a perfect example of grunge. Grunge is found everywhere and you happen to find it in nature.<br/> <br/>Personally I think the voters missed the boat on this one and you should have been well above 5 in the voting.<br/> <br/>All the best to you and yours.<br/> <br/>MAX!</td>', 'C, I''m shocked to see that the good people of DPC were unable to pull themselves along the definition of grunge a little further and if they had they would have found that this image is a perfect example of grunge. Grunge is found everywhere and you happen to find it in nature. Personally I think the voters missed the boat on this one and you should have been well above 5 in the voting. All the best to you and yours. MAX!', '2009-06-09 21:06:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(5521766, 792344, 75034, '<td valign="top">Michelle, I really like the texture in this shot and I think it should have done better. I love that you achieved this effect outside of photoshop and you pulled it off spectacularly. Good on you for being so creative and thinking outside the box.<br/> <br/>All the best to you and yours.<br/> <br/>MAX!</td>', 'Michelle, I really like the texture in this shot and I think it should have done better. I love that you achieved this effect outside of photoshop and you pulled it off spectacularly. Good on you for being so creative and thinking outside the box. All the best to you and yours. MAX!', '2009-06-09 21:11:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(5521769, 792073, 75034, '<td valign="top">Bear, first off, I love the shirt and you wear it well :) Second, I really like the effect you got by using topaz adjust (at least it looks like topaz adjust) and I think you did it just right. I find that I get a little carried away with topaz and fudge up more shots then I help so I''ve moved away from it for now until I can control myself :)<br/> <br/>It''s a great shot and it fitting for this challenge and it scored well.<br/> <br/>All the best to you and yours.<br/> <br/>MAX!</td>', 'Bear, first off, I love the shirt and you wear it well :) Second, I really like the effect you got by using topaz adjust (at least it looks like topaz adjust) and I think you did it just right. I find that I get a little carried away with topaz and fudge up more shots then I help so I''ve moved away from it for now until I can control myself :) It''s a great shot and it fitting for this challenge and it scored well. All the best to you and yours. MAX!', '2009-06-09 21:18:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(5521783, 792045, 75034, '<td valign="top">Terry, I know that some of the animal right activists have problems with the use of leather for belts so I would just like to point out that they have a thriving market for canvas and nylon belts and you could get one for about $5.00 and give it as a present. It has already been said but it bares repeating "Crack Kills"  :)<br/> <br/>All the best to you and yours.<br/> <br/>MAX!</td>', 'Terry, I know that some of the animal right activists have problems with the use of leather for belts so I would just like to point out that they have a thriving market for canvas and nylon belts and you could get one for about $5.00 and give it as a present. It has already been said but it bares repeating "Crack Kills"  :) All the best to you and yours. MAX!', '2009-06-09 21:29:17.000000', NULL, 0),
